       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. MOVEALN.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 X10 PIC X(10).
       01 N5 PIC 9(5).
       01 SN5 PIC S9(5).
       01 N3V2 PIC 9(3)V99.
       01 E1 PIC ZZZ9.99.
       01 SNUM PIC S9(3)V99 VALUE -12.34.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE "42" TO X10. MOVE X10 TO N5. DISPLAY N5.
           MOVE "12A" TO X10. MOVE X10 TO N5. DISPLAY N5.
           MOVE "  -12.5" TO X10. MOVE X10 TO SN5. DISPLAY SN5.
           MOVE "  -12.5" TO X10. MOVE X10 TO N3V2. DISPLAY N3V2.
           MOVE "ABC" TO X10. MOVE X10 TO N5. DISPLAY N5.
           MOVE "1,234.56" TO X10. MOVE X10 TO N3V2. DISPLAY N3V2.
           MOVE "1234567" TO X10. MOVE X10 TO N5. DISPLAY N5.
           MOVE "1234.5678" TO X10. MOVE X10 TO N3V2. DISPLAY N3V2.
           MOVE "-7" TO X10. MOVE X10 TO E1. DISPLAY "[" E1 "]".
           MOVE SNUM TO N5. DISPLAY N5.
           MOVE 1 TO N5.
           MOVE N5 TO X10. DISPLAY "[" X10 "]".
           STOP RUN.
